description:
Blueprints can be used to unlock crafting recipes for the corresponding Item at the Smart Workshop. They can be obtained through exploration or purchased directly from Boojee's Store - Blueprints.

Item Effect: When using Etheric Phantom, the squad's Corruption value is greatly reduced. When Lucia upgrades a skill or uses an <color=#FFFFFF>[Aftershock]</color>, she gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Surge]</color>, stacking up to 4 times;
Upon exiting the <color=#FFFFFF>[Dream]</color> state, all <color=#FFFFFF>[Surge]</color> stacks will be consumed, where each consumed stack <color=#2BAD00>regenerates 10 Energy for herself</color>.

Blueprints can be used to unlock crafting of the corresponding item in the Smart Workshop. Can be purchased from Boojee's Store - Season Limited.

